    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1675762162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1675762162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1675762162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The measured life of people has come to an end. After many years of creation, the descendants of Belial crawl out of hell and you are honored with the role of the protector of mankind. Fight for the lives of your subordinates, create an army and fight fierce battles against the forces of evil. Belial Wars is a real-time strategy game with a stylized design that will immerse you in a medieval world full of dangers.<br><br>Control your army and don't let the forces of evil penetrate into the dimension of people through the portal.<br><br>Be guided by your battle tactics that will lead you to victory.<br><br>Build your kingdom and protect humanity.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1675762162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1675762162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185970/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1675762162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The measured life of people has come to an end. After many years of creation, the descendants of Belial crawl out of hell and you are honored with the role of the protector of mankind. Fight for the lives of your subordinates, create an army and fight fierce battles against the forces of evil. Belial Wars is a real-time strategy game with a stylized design that will immerse you in a medieval world full of dangers.<br><br>Control your army and don't let the forces of evil penetrate into the dimension of people through the portal.<br><br>Be guided by your battle tactics that will lead you to victory.<br><br>Build your kingdom and protect humanity.",
